.idea
# Env files stay out of the image. Consequence: `vite build --mode ce` inside the
# image cannot read `.env.ce.local`, so instance config must arrive as build args
# — see the ARG block in Dockerfile plus docs/agents/web-hotpatch-deploy.md.
.env
.env.*
# Keep worker/ in the build context: tsc -b (via `pnpm build:ce`) compiles the
# test suite under src/, and src/__tests__/worker/cache-headers.test.ts imports
# worker/index. Excluding worker/ breaks the Docker build with TS2307 even
# though the nginx runtime image never ships it.
wrangler.jsonc
.wrangler
.cache
